  "ingredients": [
    "1 (1 pound) loaf French bread, cut diagonally in 1 inch slices",
    "8 eggs",
    "2 cups milk",
    "1.5 cups half-and-half cream",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "0.75 cup butter",
    "1.3333333730698 cups brown sugar",
    "3 tablespoons light corn syrup"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Butter a 9x13-inch baking dish; arrange slices of bread on the bottom.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat eggs, milk, cream, vanilla, and cinnamon together in a large bowl. Pour over bread slices, cover, and refrigerate overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/itc7-FT_Z9hPBPzB6vWtaLx5H-8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20934-baked-french-toast-step-2-BP-2963-c519f74921184188bf194be71dd2a67e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20934/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "The next morning, preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Meanwhile, combine butter, brown sugar, and corn syrup together in a small saucepan; heat until bubbling.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KH75sb8BMfBwlFqERofLOJ14RAI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20934-baked-french-toast-step-3-BP-2973-29fa5ceedebb411b846fce7f4ccefc73.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20934/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour over bread and egg mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/C2ivEY5Zl5EN5bdr_5png3TEORM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20934-baked-french-toast-step-4-BP-2978-44fb5f99324343869e57654241fc5c56.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20934/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in preheated oven, uncovered, for 40 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve with berries and syrup.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
